"(Experts Only) Sets the context that calls will originate from. Leave this "
"as from-internal unless you know what you're doing."
msgstr "（僅限專家）設定通話所源自的 context。除非您知道自己在做什麼，否則請保留 from-internal。"

#: views/form.php:221
